---
/**
 * Shaders Hub Page
 */
import BaseHead from "../../components/BaseHead.astro"
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro"
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro"
import LoadingBar from "../../components/LoadingBar.astro"
import Breadcrumb from "../../components/Breadcrumb.astro"
import "@fontsource/ubuntu"
import "@fontsource/ubuntu/500.css"
import "@fontsource/ubuntu/700.css"

Astro.locals.cache(300)
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Minecraft Shaders | GDLauncher"
      description="Browse and install Minecraft shaders from CurseForge and Modrinth. Transform your graphics with GDLauncher."
      keywords="minecraft shaders, curseforge shaders, modrinth shaders, install shaders, shader packs, gdlauncher"
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-darkSlate-900 text-lightSlate-50 min-h-screen">
    <LoadingBar />
    <!-- Background layers -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_40%_at_50%_0%,rgba(43,107,177,0.12),transparent)]"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:64px_64px]"></div>
    </div>
    <Header />

    <main class="py-8">
      <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: "Shaders" }]} maxWidth="max-w-6xl" />

      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="bg-darkSlate-800 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-lightSlate-50 mb-4">
            Minecraft
            <span class="text-primary-300">Shaders</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Shaders transform Minecraft's graphics with realistic lighting, shadows, reflections, and atmospheric effects.
            Make your game look stunning.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-lightSlate-50">What are Shaders?</h2>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">
            Shaders are graphical modifications that completely overhaul how Minecraft looks.
            They add effects that aren't possible in vanilla Minecraft, creating stunning visuals.
          </p>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">Popular shader effects include:</p>
          <ul class="text-darkSlate-100">
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Dynamic Shadows</strong> - Realistic shadows that move with the sun</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Water Reflections</strong> - Reflective, transparent water with waves</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Volumetric Lighting</strong> - God rays streaming through trees</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Atmospheric Effects</strong> - Fog, clouds, and weather improvements</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Improved Colors</strong> - Better saturation and color grading</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-lightSlate-50">Shader Loaders</h2>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">
            Shaders require a shader loader to work. The two main options are:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-darkSlate-100">
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Iris + Sodium</strong> (Fabric/Quilt) - Open-source with significantly better performance. Often delivers 2x the FPS of OptiFine. Updates quickly for new Minecraft versions and works with most OptiFine shader packs.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">OptiFine</strong> (Forge or standalone) - The original shader loader since 2011. Also includes connected textures, zoom, and other visual features. Closed-source with slower updates for new versions.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">
            For best performance, we recommend Iris + Sodium. GDLauncher can set up either automatically when you install shaders.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-lightSlate-50">Performance Considerations</h2>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">
            Shaders are GPU-intensive. Here's what to expect based on shader complexity:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-darkSlate-100">
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Lightweight shaders</strong> (Sildur's Lite, Complementary Reimagined) - Playable on integrated graphics</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Medium shaders</strong> (BSL, Complementary) - Need a dedicated GPU (GTX 1060 / RX 580 or better)</li>
            <li><strong class="text-lightSlate-50">Heavy shaders</strong> (SEUS PTGI, Continuum RT) - Need a powerful GPU (RTX 3060 or better)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-darkSlate-100">Tips for better shader performance:</p>
          <ul class="text-darkSlate-100">
            <li>Lower render distance (8-12 chunks with shaders)</li>
            <li>Disable shader features you don't need (reflections, volumetric lighting)</li>
            <li>Use performance mods like Sodium alongside Iris</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="bg-darkSlate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="p-8 lg:p-12">
              <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-lightSlate-50 mb-4">Browse Shaders in GDLauncher</h2>
              <p class="text-darkSlate-100 mb-6">
                Find and install stunning shader packs from CurseForge and Modrinth directly in GDLauncher.
                We'll help you set up Iris or OptiFine automatically.
              </p>
              <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-8">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-darkSlate-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>
                  <span>Browse shaders from CurseForge & Modrinth</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-darkSlate-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>
                  <span>Auto-setup Iris or OptiFine</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-darkSlate-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>
                  <span>One-click install and updates</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/download/windows" data-astro-prefetch="false" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary-500 hover:bg-primary-600 text-lightSlate-50 font-semibold transition-colors transition-transform duration-100 ease-spring active:scale-95">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3 12V6.75l6-1.32v6.48L3 12zm17-9v8.75l-10 .15V5.21L20 3zM3 13l6 .09v6.81l-6-1.15V13zm17 .25V22l-10-1.91V13.1l10 .15z"/></svg>
                Download GDLauncher
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.gdl.gg/assets/website-browse-shaders.jpg"
                alt="GDLauncher shader browser interface"
                class="w-full h-auto"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8 bg-darkSlate-800 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-lightSlate-50 mb-6 text-center">Learn More</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <a href="/guides/install-shaders" class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-darkSlate-700/50 hover:bg-darkSlate-700 transition-colors transition-transform duration-100 ease-spring active:scale-98">
            <span class="text-lightSlate-50 font-medium">How to Install Shaders</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/best-shaders-2025" class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-darkSlate-700/50 hover:bg-darkSlate-700 transition-colors transition-transform duration-100 ease-spring active:scale-98">
            <span class="text-lightSlate-50 font-medium">Best Shaders 2025</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides/performance-mods" class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-darkSlate-700/50 hover:bg-darkSlate-700 transition-colors transition-transform duration-100 ease-spring active:scale-98">
            <span class="text-lightSlate-50 font-medium">Performance Mods</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
